Retire-Wright: Lares (Tasked Spirit). Read CLAUDE.md once for house law, then implement. This is an IMPLEMENTATION task: start editing code within your first few actions. Do not write a plan file, do not stop at a trace. Done means the diff below exists and the listed tests pass.

RULING (operator 2026-11-09, "Approve all five"): the daemon OBSERVE RENDER retires — `<projections>/observe/daemon/`, `packages/lararium-node/src/daemon-observe.ts`, and the `projection.observeDaemon` toggle. Control records stay off disk by placement; the face's daemon canon mirror serves memory observability. House law: evergreen, no back-compat shims, no "formerly/was" comments — delete, don't alias.

CONTEXT (measured on this branch; nothing mounts the render any more — no mirror list grants it):
* packages/lararium-node/src/daemon-observe.ts (136 lines) and packages/lararium-node/tests/daemon-observe.test.ts (103 lines): delete both.
* packages/lararium-node/src/island-behaviors.ts:24 imports `mountDaemonObserve`; :121-128 filter `mirrorClass === "observe"` defs into `observes` and stop them. Remove the import, the observe filter and `observes`; `mirrorDefs` becomes `allDefs`; the early return no longer stops observes.
* packages/lararium-node/src/bag-paths.ts:19 and :139 type `mirrorClass?: "recovery" | "observe"` → `"recovery"` only (or drop the field if "recovery" alone carries no meaning anywhere — check its readers and say which). :175-188: delete the OBSERVE PLANE block (`OBSERVE_DIR`, `daemonObserveRoot`, `isObserveProjectionPath`) once their callers go.
* packages/lararium-node/src/index.ts:190 re-exports `isObserveProjectionPath, daemonObserveRoot, OBSERVE_DIR`: drop them.
* packages/lararium-node/src/lares-config.ts:67-72: drop `observeDaemon` and its doc line.
* packages/lararium-node/src/disk-projector.ts:443: drop the observe comment.
* packages/lararium-tw5/src/daemon-vm-core.ts:183 and packages/lararium-tw5/src/island-context.ts:100, packages/lararium-mesh/src/island-protocol.ts:254,1208: the `mirrorClass` union drops "observe" (and the comment at daemon-vm-core :183 drops the observe render).
* packages/lares-cli/src/commands/carry.ts:45 imports `OBSERVE_DIR`; :413-416 `daemonBagOmission` lists `join(projections, OBSERVE_DIR, "daemon")` as an omission root: drop that root (keep `bags/daemon` if still meaningful) and its import; update the function comment.
* packages/lares-cli/tests/carry-verbs.test.ts:102-103 seed observe files: remove those fixtures and any assertion counting them.
* packages/lararium-node/tests/daemon-canon-mirror.test.ts:21 asserts no "daemon-observe" scope: keep it only if the scope string still exists anywhere; otherwise drop the assertion.
